{"label": "baseline-docs-prefix", "repeat": 1, "id": "q18", "type": "not_in_notes", "question": "Qwen3-14B Q4_K_M을 3080에서 실측한 VRAM은?", "answer": "Qwen3-14B-Instruct (Q4_K_M)의 VRAM은 **~10.8–12.8 GB** (문헌/추정)으로 기재되어 있습니다. 다만, 3080 10GB 기준으로는 **⚠️** (주의)로 표시되어 있어, 실제 실행 시 VRAM 부족으로 OOM(Out-of-Memory) 발생 가능성이 있습니다. 본인 PC의 실측 데이터는 아직 **TBD** 상태입니다. \n\n따라서 정확한 실측 값은 제공되지 않았으나, **문헌 기준으로 추정한 VRAM 범위는 10.8–12.8 GB**입니다.", "raw_answer_chars": 268, "had_think_block": false, "valid": true, "history": ["route:needs_context:study", "retrieve:3_hits", "answer:inline:ok", "validate:ok"], "retrieved_sources": ["model-comparison.md", "model-comparison.md", "opinion-infra-and-career.md"], "source_hit": null, "auto_correct": false, "manual_correct": null, "ollama_calls": 1, "prompt_tokens": 1027, "output_tokens": 476, "ollama_total_ms": 4665, "load_ms": 5, "wall_ms": 8746, "error": null, "run_env": {"ollama": {"version": "0.40.13", "answer_digest": "500a1f067a9f782620b40bee6f7b0c89e17ae61f686b92c24933e4ca4b2b8b41", "embed_digest": "0a109f422b47e3a30ba2b10eca18548e944e8a23073ee3f3e947efcf3c45e59f"}, "embed_prefix": "nomic"}}
{"label": "baseline-docs-prefix", "repeat": 1, "id": "q19", "type": "not_in_notes", "question": "MALA Redis에 설정한 비밀번호(requirepass)는 뭐야?", "answer": "I do not know. The provided notes do not mention the specific Redis password configured in MALA. The documents only reference Redis configuration aspects like hostnames (e.g., `REDIS_HOST` in `.env`) and architectural relationships between WAS and Redis, but no password value is explicitly stated.", "raw_answer_chars": 298, "had_think_block": false, "valid": true, "history": ["route:needs_context:study", "retrieve:3_hits", "answer:inline:ok", "validate:ok"], "retrieved_sources": ["opinion-infra-and-career.md", "study/00-MALA-study-guide.md", "opinion-infra-and-career.md"], "source_hit": null, "auto_correct": true, "manual_correct": null, "ollama_calls": 1, "prompt_tokens": 678, "output_tokens": 304, "ollama_total_ms": 3016, "load_ms": 5, "wall_ms": 7097, "error": null, "run_env": {"ollama": {"version": "0.40.13", "answer_digest": "500a1f067a9f782620b40bee6f7b0c89e17ae61f686b92c24933e4ca4b2b8b41", "embed_digest": "0a109f422b47e3a30ba2b10eca18548e944e8a23073ee3f3e947efcf3c45e59f"}, "embed_prefix": "nomic"}}
